  "limits": "Double Throw NPC impacts now reuse the existing ordered missile damage/credit/status/kill/return pipeline and captured source poison/drain/cold. Five archived HitClass fields extend the existing ordinary throwing catalog. Successful impacts issue only domissiledamage through the approved saved actor/world streams;no launch/per-impact missile-attack event,melee attempts,weapon wear or Thorns is invented. Eight provider cases cover hit,miss,block,immunity,provider removal,physical notification,lethal contact and pierce;pre-HP callbacks,exact streams,once resources,saved originals and six learned inputs pass with retained Double Throw travel/sequence and existing melee/item controls. Item status consumers run in the successful missile event phase,including fully immune zero-life-damage and lethal hits. The earlier passing C1cohort is frozen separately;fixture carrier/compiler/runner repairs are frozen. Other projectile families,modern attack/selected-hand/provider/owner/RNG/world contexts,proc-bearing in-flight saves,exceptional/PvP and full named admission remain explicit;no class certification or deployment.",
